# Agent worktrees — transient, never committed
.claude/worktrees/

# Reference recordings dropped in for review — large, and not project history.
# `*.mp4`, not `.mp4`: the latter matches only a file literally named ".mp4".
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm

# AI training (ai/) — the tree is source, the artefacts it produces are not.
#
# Originally `ai/` wholesale, which also excluded build_dataset.py, run_baseline.py,
# score_answers.py, the Colab notebook and the README. Those are the module's source and belong in
# history; the dataset is 40 hand-written examples and is the thing everything else is derived
# from. What genuinely must not be committed is what training *emits*: merged weights are ~1.2 GB.
ai/__pycache__/
ai/**/__pycache__/
ai/**/checkpoint-*/
ai/travel-intelligence/
ai/victor-travel-intelligence*/
ai/*.zip
ai/*.safetensors
ai/*.bin

# Backups
*.csv
